Rule 2 (diagonals must be a float32, float64, complex64, or complex128 if it is a tensor)
{v_1 : tensor} |= dtype_(v_1) = 7 ∨ dtype_(v_1) = 8 ∨ dtype_(v_1) = 9 ∨ dtype_(v_1) = 10
