Rule 17 (when diagonals_format is sequence, diagonals must be a tuple of three tensors)
{v_1 : tuple(tensor), v_2 : str} |= if v_2 = "sequence" then v_1.len = 3
>>
Rule 20 (when diagonals is a tensor and diagonals_format is matrix, diagonals must be a tensor of rank >= 2)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : str} |= if v_2 = "matrix" then ndim(v_1) ≥ 2
