Rule 21 (when diagonals is a tensor and diagonals_format is matrix, the last two dimensions must be equal)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : str} |= if v_2 = "matrix" then shape(v_1, ndim(v_1) - 2) = shape(v_1, ndim(v_1) - 1)
